"<div id=""mindx-practice-annual-review"">

<h2>Practice Annual Review Checklist</h2>

<div class=""subtitle"">
Review your practice’s finances, caseload, operations, marketing, and professional goals to prepare for the year ahead.
</div>

<form id=""annualReviewForm"">

<div class=""section"">
<h3>Financial Review</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed annual revenue and expenses.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Compared actual revenue with my financial goals.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed outstanding balances and unpaid claims.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed major business expenses and subscriptions.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed pricing, fees, and reimbursement rates.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Caseload & Scheduling</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed average caseload and session volume.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed cancellation and no-show patterns.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Evaluated whether my current schedule is sustainable.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified opportunities to improve scheduling efficiency.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed time spent on non-clinical work.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Clinical & Documentation</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed documentation quality and consistency.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed treatment plans and required updates.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed clinical documentation workflows.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified documentation or compliance gaps.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Operations & Systems</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed EHR and practice management systems.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed client onboarding and intake workflows.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed billing and payment processes.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed communication and administrative workflows.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified systems that should be automated or simplified.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Marketing & Referrals</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed where new client inquiries came from.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed website and directory profiles.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Evaluated referral relationships.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed marketing activities and their results.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified the most effective sources of new clients.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Professional Development</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed continuing education completed this year.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified skills or clinical areas I want to develop.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed supervision or consultation needs.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed licensure and credentialing requirements.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Sustainability & Goals</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Evaluated my current workload and boundaries.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Reviewed time off and vacation patterns.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified major sources of stress in the practice.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Identified what I want to stop, start, or continue next year.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Set specific goals for the coming year.</label>

</div>


<button type=""button"" onclick=""calculateAnnualReview()"">
Review My Practice
</button>

</form>

<div id=""annualReviewResults""></div>

<div class=""note"">
This checklist is intended for practice planning and self-review. It does not replace accounting, legal, tax, compliance, or clinical consultation.
</div>

</div>


<style>

#mindx-practice-annual-review{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
